flowchart LR
	FOLD["the multi-step direct-govern fold"]
	SAME["every step writing the SAME<br/>observed version"]
	FIRST["only the first write succeeding"]
	SILENT["the later steps failing the stale-version<br/>check silently"]
	FIX["the fix - the sequential fold awaiting<br/>each step's chain"]
	STAT["the chain pass statting the target<br/>before its write"]
	FOLD --> SAME
	SAME --> FIRST
	SAME --> SILENT
	FIX --> STAT
